{"channelId":"UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","row":["dev naz Animal Rescue",381000,"Hello! I'm Devnaz, an animal lover living in the beautiful district of Karataş in Adana, Turkey. Although I was born in Australia, my roots trace back to Turkey, and I'm dedicated to helping animals here. What started with my pet dog has now extended to street animals as well. On my YouTube channel, my team and I organize animal rescue operations, touching the lives of many creatures, including cats and dogs. Our goal is to share these meaningful stories with you, inspiring more people to help animals. Come on, join us in this amazing adventure and let's work together to create a better world!\"\n\n\"Merhaba! Ben Devnaz,  YouTube kanalımda, ekibimle birlikte hayvan kurtarma operasyonları düzenliyor, kedi ve köpek başta olmak üzere pek çok canlının hayatına dokunuyoruz. Amacımız, bu anlamlı hikayeleri sizinle paylaşarak daha fazla insanın hayvanlara yardım etmesine ilham vermek. Hadi, gelin bu müthiş maceraya katılın ve birlikte daha iyi bir dünya yaratmaya çalışalım!\"","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:04.567Z","channelId":"UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"875acb26162439d9d4dfda09c5d41c6bc3efc5162a13215aa17d66c0eced77e3","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"c7e8f8649a130b09bca0eef4c696eb4648e366f666b2cd33f08ea0107be97737"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:01:12.054Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":381000,"raw":"381K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCi-eH8ETth4jNcbNncsHWaw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:04.567Z"}],"emai